FACT: TODAY
SAAB AB BUILDS
GRIPEN JETS {b}

Real Saab people
never give up
{b}{y}{b}{y}{b}

Good morning!
Turbo warm,
coffee ready {o}

Winter? No problem.
Saab grew up
in Sweden {w}{b}

Fact: the first
Saab 92s were
all dark green {g}

While others wait
for a tow truck,
the Saab drives home

Saab 900 Turbo:
an eighties
legend {r}

Saab 92:
where it
all began {g}

The griffin
guards
this house {r}

Spare part found!
Party in
the garage {y}{y}{y}

The sky is for
birds. The road
is for Saab {b}

Good night, Saab.
We drive
tomorrow {v}
